{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_42370","headline":"和张少监晚菊 · 徐铉","name":"和张少监晚菊","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"忆共庭兰倚砌裁，柔条轻吹独依隈。\n自知佳节终堪赏，爲惜流光未忍开。\n采撷也须盈掌握，馨香还解满尊罍。\n今朝旬假犹无事，更好登临泛一盃。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"徐铉","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_42370.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_42370","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}